  "checkH": {
    "message": "Check links"
  },
  "checkIntro": {
    "message": "Asks each site if the page still exists (a HEAD request, then GET when the site refuses it). Chrome asks once for permission to reach websites; nothing else leaves your machine, and no note is changed until you choose. A page that answers 404 or 410, or a site that does not answer at all, is proposed as Dead; a link marked Dead that answers again is proposed as Active."
  },
