    "message": "How the extension recognises and writes a bookmark note. The defaults suit most folders; change them to match yours. Names are the frontmatter properties of the notes."
  },
  "sHelp": {
    "message": "Leave a property name empty to turn that field off. A status of Dead greys a link out. Hover a field for its meaning."
